15
00:00:31,342 --> 00:00:32,684
Pre-load membagi beban itu.

16
00:00:32,747 --> 00:00:34,755
Antusiasmenya juga terlihat dari uang.

17
00:00:35,255 --> 00:00:37,015
Firma riset Sensor Tower memperkirakan

18
00:00:37,035 --> 00:00:39,647
7,71 juta pre-order digital,

19
00:00:39,667 --> 00:00:41,860
