32
00:01:06,214 --> 00:01:08,222
Dan versi PC? Belum diumumkan.

33
00:01:08,277 --> 00:01:11,214
Kamu sudah siapkan ruang 212 gigabyte?

34
00:01:11,668 --> 00:01:13,443
Tulis konsolmu di komentar,

35
00:01:13,527 --> 00:01:15,720
